cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "arch17p13: 17p13.1 TP53/WRAP53 structural-variant architecture classification from VCF"
abstract: >-
  A standalone, dependency-free Python library and command-line tool that classifies
  structural variants at the chr17:7,560,000-7,710,000 (GRCh38) locus into TP53/WRAP53
  co-disruption architecture categories. Reimplements the categorization logic from a
  pre-registered computational study of alternative lengthening of telomeres in
  osteosarcoma, with the category ladder pinned against the reference implementation.
type: software
version: 0.2.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/rinatrizvanov/arch17p13"
keywords:
  - genomics
  - structural variants
  - TP53
  - WRAP53
  - TCAB1
  - 17p13.1
  - osteosarcoma
authors:
