    title: "Osteosarcoma ALT: classification, and a pre-registered dependency test"
    notes: >-
      Reference implementation of the categorization logic. The category ladder in
      arch17p13 is pinned against part1_alt_classification/src/sv_annotator.py at
      commit a750daf.
